  "mod.json": {
   "size": 2155,
   "sha256": "4b65f3c6ff45ab93646182f62653ed3ea0adeb091dc51e40d6d869e12e80b4f3",
   "json": {
    "id": "specialistforgooditems",
    "name": "The Specialist for Good Items",
    "version": "1.5.1",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "description": "[h1] DANCE! [/h1]\n\nWith this mod on, Isaac will do the Specialist dance when encountering quality 4 items.\n\n[strike]Tainteds will eventually be added![/strike]\n\nUPDATE LOG: The \"Taint to the Party\" update is finally here! The mod now covers the entire cast, both Non-Tainted and Tainted characters, and it looks like the latter even brought their own mixtape!\n\nUsing Mod Config Menu you can tweak:\n[list]\n    [*]The minimum item Quality Isaac will dance to.\n    [*]Whether Isaac'll dance with Curse of the Blind or not.\n    [*]Customize what items are dance-worthy.\n    [*]Disable the music if you prefer to do so.\n    [*]Set the default remix, or even make it play for everyone.\n    [*]Flashing lights for a particularly strobing new dance.\n[/list]\nIt is also possible to tweak these settings manually, simply tweak the variables within 'EpicSettings' located at the top of main.lua\n\nThis mod [b]is[/b] compatible with POG for Good Items, but also takes priority! Make sure they have different quality requirements so they can both be seen (since pog is for quality 3 and dance is for quality 4 by default, this is the case with no modifications).\n\n[b] Credits: [/b]\nJiftoo - Programmer\nDevector - Graphics/Trailer\n\nOriginal Pog Mod (used as a base for the mod):\nhttps://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2490515687\n\nOriginal MMD Skeleton by SAB64 (used as a base for the mod):\nhttps://www.deviantart.com/sab64/art/%28MMD-FBX-Model%29-Dr.-Doofenshmirtz-Download-871518311\n\nAnimated Items Mod used for gif preview can be found here:\nhttps://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2570913695\n\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nWe stand on the shoulders of giants: Feel free to modify/fix this mod as you see fit. You can also download the character models from the link below: thanks for the patience and support, dance on!\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1hkhDCs7qapahSjJ4KTRCUE8lBDta5irD?usp=sharing"
   }
  },
